**Proposition 9.1 (Integer conic identity).** Define

$$
N_p=156-1968b-2880b^2,\quad
N_v=-426-4092b-4800b^2,\quad D=35+35b.
$$

Then $p_b=N_p/D,v_b=N_v/D$, and

$$
525N_p^2-665N_pN_v-9108N_pD+210N_v^2+5952N_vD+35424D^2=0.
$$

